{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_06_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_06","title":"杀手女皇","storyCode":"OF-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"65fdf6e42e4c95fc58ac986903c44461292b89a935bb9a75bc61120f282e6b37","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"全、全都打倒了？我从来......都不知道你有这么厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想象过，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我不想让小姐知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"但你实在是太厉害了！好帅呀，黑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么跳那么高的！顺着墙窜上去，然后直接翻身跃下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"就在空中这么旋转，所有射击都被你躲过去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"然后扭过身体，啪啪啪，连着把他们全都射倒！天哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐......你这么说，我的脸会很烫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，黑，我要纠正一点。刚才我可没有在命令你，我只是作为朋友在请求你而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果有什么想做的事情，也可以和我说呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我们刚才怎么说来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说话！朋友，是朋友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。我们快去市政厅吧，不知道博士他们那里现在是什么情况......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"这些饭桶，连一个小姑娘都拦不住吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"可她是萨卡兹！而且对方还有其他好几个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"那不也就只有几个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可恶的罗德岛，怎么会在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"什么嘛，感觉这些家伙，怎么比源石虫还弱的样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"赶快把所有的人手都调过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"可是克洛宁先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，打不过，就是打不过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么可是！别往后退啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"呵欠......唉，博士，你找到没有啊？我还要去听LIVE呢，要是赶不上我可就亏大了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我得到了！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"嗯，已经找到账簿和债券了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？找到了啊？果然打他们一顿是有用的嘛。陨星姐也说了，暴力有时候是必要的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"该，该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，只要现在能逃走，手续什么的好补得很！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士，他从窗户逃走了！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这些资料，我们把它都带上！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"好~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，将军他还在外面吧？感觉这个克洛宁什么的的下场会很惨啊，还不如没逃走呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"来，博士，我帮你拿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈......该死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"必须，必须马上把其他人叫回来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次，罗德岛的博士和贵市的锡兰小姐从那个窗户跳了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"时来运转，现在是汐斯塔的天灾信使克洛宁先生跳出了窗户。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"人生也许很无常，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你！我的手下呢？我的手下呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"放在这里会影响游客参观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，这两位小姐已经在这里等你很久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"黑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个站在一起，也就是说......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"也就是说你要完蛋了！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"证据现在都在我们手中，你难逃法网了，先生。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，请小心，他也许还会做些垂死挣扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你的计划败露了，克洛宁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["赫拉格"]},{"speakerId":"char_290_vigna","aliases":["红豆"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["锡兰"]}]}
